            "review_text": "maverikbc\nVancouver, Canada491 contributions\n0\nNot cheap\nNov 2019 • Solo\nDespite its name brauhaus, it seems like it's Czech owned, the menu was in Vietnamese, Czech and English. I had a half litre cloudy lager for 50k. While good, I can't justify it costs 4x than the hole in the wall bia hoi places. Comfortable chairs and terrace seatings.\n\nWhile I didn't try their food, they aren't cheap, either. Vietnamese, Czech (bramboraky, etc), and international (shishamo, etc), mostly 100-200k.\n\nFree WiFi.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 3, 2019",
