            "review_text": "Maya B\nNew York City, New York1 contribution\n0\nSomething different\nApr 2019 • Friends\nThis is a good place to go to in Hanoi if are getting a bit sick of Southeast Asian bars and beer more generally, and want more space, less noise and a reasonably authentic Czech beer experience. The service is so-so, the scale and decor of the beer hall very impressive and the value of the beer, which comes in yellow and black form, very good.\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 7, 2019",
