            "review_text": "Håvard O\nOslo, Norway80 contributions\n0\nPoor service\nJul 2018 • Family\nWith about ten employees and only three/four occupied tables we were surprised with the terrible service. First they forgot the orange juice and the coke was luke warm. they managed to bring us the two spaghetti dishes we ordered, but they forgot the two other meals. When we asked them about why we hadn’t received the last two meals they seemed a bit indifferent about it but told us that something had happened and that the food would be served soon. When we finally got our last two dishes one of them came ten minutes earlier than the last one. Also, one of the dishes were supposed to be vegetarian, but actually had meat in it. The food tasted well, but I give it a terrible rating because of the terrible service. I must say I had much higher expectations.\nRead more\nWritten July 6, 2018",
