            "review_text": "HughMc\nCheadle, United Kingdom632 contributions\n0\nGood place for parties\nMay 2018 • Business\nWent here with an international conference group to one of their upstairs rooms. The service was very good and the beer quenchable and enjoyable. We also had a three course meal which was shared at the table. The meal include ham hock, which was a bit chewy. There were also sausages and other meats along with salad and rice.The rest of the meal was OK but I don't think I'll be rushing back here.\nIt was also off putting that had people smoking in the restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 3, 2018",
