            "review_text": "William R\nBaltimore, Maryland40 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Czech Beer Garden\nDec 2017 • Friends\nExcellent menu expertly prepared food. I celebrated my 60th birthday here last week after considering 3 other reputable establishments. This one had the best meeting rooms and most reasonable prices. Best part was the quality of the food, the taste of the beer and the 1st class service. Best choice for meetings. Should be good for a regular dinner with your date too!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 22, 2017",
