            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Vien Brauhaus",
            "review_text": "HughMc\nCheadle, United Kingdom632 contributions\n0\nNot where I'd expected a Czech experience\nMay 2017 • Friends\nThis is a large 'beer kellar' type of bar/restaurant based on two floors and an outside area. The decor was polished wood throughout and gave you the impression of being in Europe not Vietnam. There was a good range of beers brewed and soft drinks, the meal was OK - we had a mixture of Vietnamese and Western foods in a room upstairs. The service was very good - but when I asked for a banana I was given a plateful of 6 Vietnamese (smaller and wider)! Overall this was a very pleasant experience and I would have no hesitation in returning.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 9, 2017",
