            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Vien Brauhaus",
            "review_text": "mervdunia\nPhnom Penh, Cambodia102 contributions\n0\nsuperb atmosphere and conviviality\nApr 2017 • Solo\nThree Vietnamese cities are blessed to have a Hoa Vien Brauhaus...besides Hanoi and HCMC, there is one located on the coast, conjoining Mui Ne and Phan Thiet.\nThe setting is like a Bohemian style beer hall...and it has Czech roots (not German, as some posters have surmised). The Becherovka shots are the tell-tale here...and Czech-style fried cheese is one of the top 'beer' snacks.\nService is great - remarkably few foreigners when I was there on numerous occasions.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 1, 2017",
